  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent: score=1.5068293450, n=768\nLengths to try: [1024, 768, 1536]\nTotal budget: 1770s\nPhase 1: Initialization\nTop 8 initializations:\n  parent_768: 1.50682935\n  parent_1536: 1.52277649\n  parent_1024: 1.54210698\n  linear_1536: 1.96868322\n  linear_1024: 1.96892332\n  linear_768: 1.96916362\n  flat_spec_1024: 2.08947041\n  flat_spec_1536: 2.09912673\n\nPhase 2: L-BFGS optimization (6 candidates, ~245s each)\n  [1/6] L-BFGS on parent_768 (n=768), init=1.50682935, budget=245s\n    L-BFGS result: 1.5068293450\n    Peak shave: 1.5068293450\n    LP refine: 1.5068277038 (improved!)\n  [2/6] L-BFGS on parent_1536 (n=1536), init=1.52277649, budget=245s\n    L-BFGS result: 1.5136927000\n    Peak shave: 1.5136927000\n  [3/6] L-BFGS on parent_1024 (n=1024), init=1.54210698, budget=245s\n    L-BFGS result: 1.5143999872\n    Peak shave: 1.5143999872\n    LP refine: 1.5143999872\n  Skipping linear_1536 (n=1536): init score 1.968683 too high\n  Skipping linear_1024 (n=1024): init score 1.968923 too high\n  Skipping linear_768 (n=768): init score 1.969164 too high\n\nPhase 5: Fine gradient polish, budget=120s\n  Fine polish: 1.5068265118\n\nPhase 6: Random restarts, budget=1620s\n\nEvaluate_sequence score: 1.5068265118\nFINAL: score=1.5068265118, n=768, time=149.6s",
